    airo:evidenceText "In 2014, the newspaper El Mundo published a leaked document from the General Council of the Judiciary that showed that 14 out of 15 women who were killed that year, having reported their aggressor before, had low or non-specific risk." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1401" .

