    airo:evidenceText "The formula used in VioGén is a \"simple algorithm,\" according to Juan José López Ossorio, a psychologist who has been in charge of VioGén from its early stages, in a written statement to AlgorithmWatch." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8630" .

